@* =================================================================================================
   FILE: Maroos.Web/Components/Account/Pages/_Imports.razor
   ORIGIN: generated by the Blazor Identity template; Maroos uses it unchanged.
   PURPOSE: Applies to every page in this folder and below. It imports the shared account components, and
   [ExcludeFromInteractiveRouting] makes these pages always render statically (a full page load), because
   signing in and out must set cookies, which only a normal HTTP response can do.
   ================================================================================================= *@
@using Maroos.Web.Components.Account.Shared
@attribute [ExcludeFromInteractiveRouting]
